WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.120
Welcome. These are the actual NDH SchoolOS
pages, with fictional demo records. Start

2
00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:13.094
on the homepage and choose Register Your
School. On a phone, scroll to the button.

3
00:00:13.094 --> 00:00:15.790
No real school accounts are involved.

4
00:00:18.042 --> 00:00:23.362
Enter your school name, country and
address. Upload your own school crest if

5
00:00:23.362 --> 00:00:29.032
available. Check the details, then choose
Next. We are using a fictional training

6
00:00:29.032 --> 00:00:31.692
school, not registering a real school.

7
00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:38.920
Enter the owner's name, administrator
email and a strong password. Keep your

8
00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:44.207
real password private. Select Next to
review your session, term, programmes and

9
00:00:44.207 --> 00:00:49.829
classes. Complete registration on the live
service and follow any email confirmation

10
00:00:49.829 --> 00:00:54.513
instructions. We will not create a real
account in this demonstration.

11
00:00:56.625 --> 00:01:01.830
For an existing owner account, choose Sign
In and enter your email and password.

12
00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:06.190
Staff and parents use their
school-provisioned phone and four-digit

13
00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:11.005
PIN. This local demo session shows the
dashboard, not live authentication.

14
00:01:13.167 --> 00:01:18.960
On a phone, open the navigation menu. On
desktop, use the sidebar. Choose Settings

15
00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:24.471
to review your crest, name and motto.
Scroll to School portal and accounts for

16
00:01:24.471 --> 00:01:28.287
the short link. Share that link, not your
owner login.

17
00:01:30.542 --> 00:01:34.675
Open Staff and Payroll, then Staff
Directory. Filter teaching and

18
00:01:34.675 --> 00:01:39.826
non-teaching staff. Support staff can be
paid without teaching accounts. Review a

19
00:01:39.826 --> 00:01:43.642
teacher's class and subject assignments in
one staff record.

20
00:01:45.792 --> 00:01:50.092
Leave the optional Quran module off for a
conventional school, or enable it when

21
00:01:50.092 --> 00:01:52.242
your school needs memorization tracking.

22
00:01:54.333 --> 00:01:59.266
Return to the dashboard and choose a
learner's Report Card. This opens the

23
00:01:59.266 --> 00:02:04.466
actual A four print preview. On a phone
the same paper scales down; the report

24
00:02:04.466 --> 00:02:10.065
itself does not rearrange. Check the full
page and margins before printing or saving

25
00:02:10.065 --> 00:02:11.213
to PDF.

26
00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:19.085
Open your school's link and choose Install
school app. The help explains the Safari

27
00:02:19.085 --> 00:02:24.468
and Chrome steps. Sign in online and open
needed records before working offline.

28
00:02:24.468 --> 00:02:29.717
Reconnect with the app open and review
sync or conflict messages. Installation

29
00:02:29.717 --> 00:02:33.620
and live offline sync are not being
verified in this demo.
